    <h1 style="text-align: center;">Kamen Rider Character Gallery</h1>
    <hr>

<div class="search-container">
    <input type="text" placeholder="Search character..." />
    <button type="button">Search</button>
</div>


<div class="image-row">
    <figure class="gallery-item">
        <a href="details.html">
        <img src="kamen_rider_decade_by_prasblacker_ddlkczd.png" alt="Kamen Rider Decade">
        </a>
        <figcaption>This is <b>Tsukasa Kadoya</b> also known as <b>Kamen Rider Decade</b>. His motif is barcodes and the number 10. He comes off as abrasive, self-righteous and cynical, but due to his good looks most people ignore it.</figcaption>
         <a href="details.html" class="details-btn">View Details</a>
    </figure>

    <figure class="gallery-item">
        <a href="details.html">
        <img src="kamen_rider_kuuga_by_prasblacker_ddljgcw.png" alt="Kamen Rider Kuuga">
        </a>
        <figcaption>This is <b>Yusuke Godai</b> also known as <b>Kamen Rider Kuuga</b>. His motif is a stag beetle. He is a happy-go-lucky honest optimist who loves to see the good in everything. His wish is to make everyone smile!</figcaption>
         <a href="details.html" class="details-btn">View Details</a>
    </figure>

    <figure class="gallery-item">
        <a href="details.html">
        <img src="kamen_rider_kabuto_by_prasblacker_ddlji2m.png" alt="Kamen Rider Kabuto">
        </a>
         <figcaption>This is <b>Souji Tendou</b> also known as <b>Kamen Rider Kabuto</b>. His motif is insects, more specifically the Japanese rhino beetle. He is infamously self-absorbed and highly confident in himself, and unapologetically believes he is the center of the universe. Behind his massive ego he is protective of his friends.</figcaption>
          <a href="details.html" class="details-btn">View Details</a>
    </figure>
<figure class="gallery-item">
    <a href="details.html">
    <img src="kamen_rider_gaim_render_by_decade1945_de2fg2g.png" alt="Kamen Rider Gaim">
    </a>
     <figcaption>This is <b>Kouta Kazuraba</b> also known as <b>Kamen Rider Gaim</b>. His motif is fruits, warriors, and armor. He is an earnest naive young man who is trying to figure out his place in the world after joining a street dancing group. </figcaption>
    <a href="details.html" class="details-btn">View Details</a>
</figure>

<figure class="gallery-item">
    <a href="details.html">
    <img src="kamen_rider_gavv_render_by_stainrender_dhukbgo.png" alt="Kamen Rider Gavv">
    </a>
     <figcaption>This is <b>Shoma Inoue</b> also known as <b>Kamen Rider Gavv</b>. His motif is candy and snack foods. As a half-human half-alien hybrid, he loves to eat human snacks and has a carefree, gentle demeanor. </figcaption>
         <a href="details.html" class="details-btn">View Details</a>
</figure>
    </div>
</body>
</html>